  "description": "Mun Geon-U’s first love comes crashing into him smelling like the sweetest cookie around! After learning he’s a new bakery owner in town named Yu Ha-Jin, Geon-U asks him for a part-time job in the hopes of winning over his heart. Unfortunately, his plan is doomed from the start as Ha-Jin is completely done with relationships now. But a little pushback is hardly an issue for the ace judo athlete Geon-U. He’s prepared to do anything to make Ha-Jin fall for him, even if that means letting the baker squeeze his hot buns...! \n\n(Source: Tappytoon, edited)",
